{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46199","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十三 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腾腾兀兀步迟迟，兆朕消磨只自知。\n龙猛金膏虽未作，孙登土窟且相宜。\n薜萝山帔偏能𫃷，橡栗年粮亦且支\n已得真人好消息，人间天上更无疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}